      "text": "Shadow branch diff/changelog — since .kspec/ is git-tracked, we could show changes to stored artifacts (workflows, tasks, specs, inbox) over time. Something like kspec history @ref or kspec diff --since '1 week ago' that leverages the git history on kspec-meta branch. Could show task state transitions, spec evolution, workflow modifications, etc.",
